WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.417
"Does Astragalus Have Benefits
for Life Extension and Fighting Cancer?"

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:09.540
In 2008, it was reported
that a screening

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:11.520
of traditional
Chinese medicine plants

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:14.700
identified a compound
called cycloastragenol

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:16.920
in the roots
of the astragalus plant

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:19.260
that appeared
to moderately enhance

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:20.520
telomerase activation.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.680
That's an enzyme
I've covered before

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:25.860
that our body uses
to try to reverse one aspect

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:29.400
of cellular aging
by elongating your telomeres,

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:31.680
the protective caps
on your chromosomes.

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:32.940
Three years later,

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:35.400
after it was shown
to elongate short telomeres

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:37.920
and improve healthspan
(though not lifespan) in mice,

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:40.620
a one-year human trial
was published.

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:42.900
Although in most of the subjects

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:45.060
telomeres continued
to shorten on average,

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:47.280
there did seem to be
a significant reduction

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:50.400
in the proportion of cells
with critically short telomeres.

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:52.320
And the side effects
looked good,

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:53.910
including a drop
in LDL cholesterol

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:54.720
and blood pressure.

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:57.120
But there was no control group

00:00:57.120 --> 00:01:00.840
and cycloastragenol
(branded as "TA-65")

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:04.080
was but one
of over fifty vitamins,

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:06.180
minerals, herbs,
and other compounds they gave

00:01:06.180 --> 00:01:07.980
to the research subjects
that year.

00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:12.180
When TA-65 was finally
properly put to the test

00:01:12.180 --> 00:01:13.740
in randomized controlled trials,

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:15.660
there was no cholesterol

00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:17.460
or blood pressure benefit
whatsoever,

00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:20.400
but in cytomegalovirus-positive
patients,

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:22.560
a significant
telomere-lengthening effect

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:25.620
was demonstrated at one dose
but not another.

00:01:25.620 --> 00:01:28.080
(Those with
chronic viral infections,

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:29.400
such as CMV or HIV,

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:31.440
tend to have white blood cells

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:33.600
with especially truncated
telomeres.)

00:01:34.140 --> 00:01:36.540
The only such study
showing clinical benefit

00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:39.480
was a year-long pilot study
of TA-65

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:41.880
for early age-related
macular degeneration,

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:44.640
though it was funded
by the company

00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:48.540
that sells it
for $600 a bottle.

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:50.940
They grossed
more than $50 million

00:01:50.940 --> 00:01:52.860
before the Federal
Trade Commission charged them

00:01:52.860 --> 00:01:55.260
with false and deceptive
claims and practices.

00:01:55.980 --> 00:01:58.920
That $600
buys you less than a gram

00:01:58.920 --> 00:02:01.020
of astragalus root extract.

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:03.700
You can buy
astragalus root extract in bulk

00:02:03.700 --> 00:02:07.500
50,000 times cheaper
for less than $20 a pound,

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:11.520
should there ever be
independently verified benefits.

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:14.940
Astragalus root,
well-known as huáng qí in China,

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:18.720
is one of the most popular herbs
in traditional Chinese medicine,

00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:21.540
included in hundreds
of herbal formulas

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:23.340
and evidently widely marketed

00:02:23.340 --> 00:02:26.220
for millennia
as a "life prolonging" tonic.

00:02:27.240 --> 00:02:28.980
No data on that,

00:02:28.980 --> 00:02:31.440
but about 30 grams a day
appeared to help

00:02:31.440 --> 00:02:33.900
with a type
of autoimmune kidney disease

00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:36.120
called idiopathic
membranous nephropathy

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:38.340
in 50 randomized
controlled trials,

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:40.560
but not
placebo-controlled trials;

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:42.960
so, any placebo effects
can't be discounted.

00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:45.180
Pregnant or nursing women

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:47.640
are cautioned against
using astragalus,

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:49.980
and a theoretical concern
was raised

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:51.660
that it may activate
a certain oncogene,

00:02:51.660 --> 00:02:53.460
a potentially
cancer-causing gene.

00:02:53.460 --> 00:02:55.920
However,
dozens of randomized trials

00:02:55.920 --> 00:02:57.780
of astragalus-based
herbal preparations

00:02:57.780 --> 00:03:00.060
as an add-on therapy
to chemotherapy

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:02.460
for the most common type
of lung cancer

00:03:02.460 --> 00:03:04.500
(non-small-cell) found,
if anything,

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:06.420
astragalus to be protective.

00:03:07.140 --> 00:03:12.060
Lung cancer is the leading cause
of cancer death in the U.S.

00:03:12.060 --> 00:03:15.420
Adding astragalus
to standard platinum-based chemo

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:18.480
reduced the risk of death
as much as 38 percent

00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:21.120
at the one-year-mark,
and 25 percent at two years.

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:23.700
However, in almost all trials,

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:27.300
the astragalus was just one
of many herbs used in a formula,

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:30.600
making the effects of astragalus
impossible to tease out,

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:31.800
and unfortunately,

00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:34.560
publication bias
is widespread

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:36.960
in the traditional
Chinese medicine literature,

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:40.500
where inconvenient results
may be quietly shelved,

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:43.440
though this in no way
unique to that field.

00:03:43.980 --> 00:03:47.940
Similar remarkable results,
with similar critical caveats,

00:03:47.940 --> 00:03:50.100
were published for
astragalus-containing formulas

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:51.360
for colorectal cancer,

00:03:51.360 --> 00:03:53.460
including
improved quality of life.

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:55.020
Same thing with cervical cancer,

00:03:55.020 --> 00:03:58.380
with remarkably reduced
chemotherapy toxicity:

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:00.360
less nausea and vomiting,

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:01.740
less hair loss,

00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:03.360
less nerve damage,

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:05.760
and less liver
and kidney toxicity.

00:04:06.480 --> 00:04:09.600
Also, less lung damage
from radiation treatments,

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:10.680
and for stomach cancer,

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:14.580
improved quality of life
and quantity of life.

